{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939760/extras/4d22e4eae50d11009bb61947ed56682a.avif?t=1761824730\" width=609 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step into the world of Mokitons</strong> \u2013 mysterious creatures that can befriend you, fight for you, and grow alongside you. You are a rookie trainer with a big dream: to build your very own Tamer Town. But first, you\u2019ll need to prove yourself by earning badges across a vast and ever-changing land.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939760/extras/3c570b9ef3331735845eeec56abd6ba2.avif?t=1761824730\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939760/extras/1fbe867276b11fbb424f30582bb78476.poster.avif?t=1761824730\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939760/extras/1fbe867276b11fbb424f30582bb78476.webm?t=1761824730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939760/extras/1fbe867276b11fbb424f30582bb78476.mp4?t=1761824730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two journeys are the same. Each city, route, and encounter is procedurally generated, ensuring that every run feels fresh and full of surprises. Along the way, you\u2019ll capture new Mokitons, fuse them into powerful evolutions, and face critical decisions that shape both your team and your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What path will you take? Which battles will you fight? And what kind of team will you build when the stakes are highest?</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939760/extras/3c570b9ef3331735845eeec56abd6ba2.avif?t=1761824730\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939760/extras/aad69a5c17a3ddd9f7cfacfaf7aeb848.poster.avif?t=1761824730\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939760/extras/aad69a5c17a3ddd9f7cfacfaf7aeb848.webm?t=1761824730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939760/extras/aad69a5c17a3ddd9f7cfacfaf7aeb848.mp4?t=1761824730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939760/extras/3c570b9ef3331735845eeec56abd6ba2.avif?t=1761824730\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Journey town to town</strong> on your quest for badges and glory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C<strong>atch and train Mokitons</strong> \u2013 assemble a team that reflects your strategy and style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fuse, evolve, and upgrade</strong> your creatures with unique items and special mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make meaningful choices</strong>: where to travel, who to challenge, and how to shape your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encounter shops</strong>, hospitals, spas, and fusion points along your path.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Totems and random events</strong> offer powerful buffs, risky debuffs, and one-of-a-kind rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>hybrid battle system</strong> that combines real-time action with turn-based tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the ultimate challenge in the <strong>Stadium Showdown</strong>, where only the strongest trainers survive.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939760/extras/3c570b9ef3331735845eeec56abd6ba2.avif?t=1761824730\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939760/extras/cfb7b3a9ecfd7aa04722924d6a0e6e86.poster.avif?t=1761824730\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939760/extras/cfb7b3a9ecfd7aa04722924d6a0e6e86.webm?t=1761824730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939760/extras/cfb7b3a9ecfd7aa04722924d6a0e6e86.mp4?t=1761824730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3939760/extras/3c570b9ef3331735845eeec56abd6ba2.avif?t=1761824730\" width=1200 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your story is one of humble beginnings \u2013 a trainer from nowhere, armed only with courage and curiosity. With each badge earned, each Mokiton caught, and each decision made, you come closer to proving yourself worthy of creating a home for trainers and Mokitons alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you rise from obscurity and carve your name into legend? The journey awaits.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img c